; Title loop. The demo fallback phrase: 23 quarter-notes in D minor.
; At the written 138 BPM (92 BPM x 1.5) the loop is exactly 10.0 seconds.
; It starts on an attack from silence and ends in a rest, so a player can
; loop the file without a click. Pulse lead, square harmony, triangle bass,
; short noise ticks. This is an original phrase, not a transcription.
@title Title loop
@tempo 138
@master 15 15
@seamless

A | o5 v28 w pulse p15,13 q7 l4
  d f a g f d c
  o4 a
  r1
  a
  o5 c d f2 d c d2 & d4 & d20
  r5
B | o4 v23 w square p13,15 q8 l4
  f1 d1 a1 f1
  d2 & d4
  d2 & d4 & d20
  r5
C | o2 v26 w triangle p15,15 q8 l4
  d1 f1 g1 d1
  a2 & a4
  d2 & d4 & d20
  r5
E | n1 nf18 v16 p12,12 q8
  [c64 [r64]15]8
  r1
  [c64 [r64]15]10
  r4
